{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>起初，雷軍發文稱，「小米YU7，少量現車，可享『3年零利息』金融政策：首付7.99元起，三年月供4267元起。」被網友們發現首付價格少寫了一個「萬」字，隨後雷軍在評論區更正：「首付7.99萬元起！」並同步修改了微博。</p>\n<p>網友們也在評論區紛紛玩梗，「雷總下次發微博不要着急，核對好了」，「我差點就掏空信用卡了」，「7.99元交個朋友」。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/tech/transform/152/w550h402/20261103/36aa-c905d398a66bc50dd2afb8d4ade760c3.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/tech/transform/152/w550h402/20261103/36aa-c905d398a66bc50dd2afb8d4ade760c3.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:42:33.943274+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:32:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T01:18:58.525265+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:39:04.701054+00:00","content_hash":"f275d06e68ecd520770c42ba0271d64ec2ccc275e94d51f7b646552707f58827","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}